  "Built-in Agents": "内置 Agent",
  "Show Paperclip-managed built-in agent surfaces, including built-in roster badges, the Built-in agents tab, and built-in agent setup controls.": "显示 Paperclip 管理的内置 agent 界面，包括内置名册徽章、内置 agent 标签页和设置控件。",
  "Durable work products (blog posts, tweet storms…) that tasks create and iterate on. Adds the Cases tab and the agent case API.": "任务创建并迭代的持久工作产物（博客、推文串等）。添加 Cases 标签页和 agent 案例 API。",
  "Turning Cases off hides the tab and blocks the case API; existing case data is kept.": "关闭 Cases 会隐藏标签页并阻断案例 API。已有数据保留。",
  "Classic Task Interface": "经典任务界面",
  "Restores the previous task detail page: the page-level header with inline description editing, the plain comment thread, and the fixed Properties sidebar. Chat-only features — streaming activity folding, inline plan and question cards, the three-mode composer — are unavailable in the classic view.": "恢复旧版任务详情页：页级 header 内联编辑描述、纯评论线程、固定 Properties 侧栏。仅聊天功能（流式活动折叠、内联 plan 与问题卡、三模式输入框）在经典视图不可用。",
  "Switching takes effect immediately. No task data is affected.": "切换立即生效。不影响任务数据。",
  "Conference Room Chat": "会议室聊天",
  "Adds a Conference Room — one chat where you and your whole team work together — plus the live activity feed and the redesigned onboarding. Also restyles task threads as chat bubbles. Turn off anytime to restore the classic UI.": "添加会议室——你和全队在一个聊天里协作——以及实时活动流和重新设计的 onboarding，并把任务线程改成聊天气泡。随时可关回经典 UI。",
  "Show the Decisions item in the main sidebar — the attention home that surfaces the tasks awaiting your input — while the surface is still being evaluated.": "在主侧边栏显示 Decisions 项——呈现等你输入任务的注意力首页。界面仍在评估中。",
  "Enable Environments": "启用环境管理",
  "Show environment management in company settings and allow project and agent environment assignment controls.": "在公司设置中显示环境管理，允许项目和 agent 的环境分配控件。",
  "Enable External Objects": "启用外部对象",
  "Detect external URLs in issues and show resolved status for pull requests, tickets, and other referenced work objects.": "检测 issue 中的外部 URL，显示 PR、工单等被引用工作对象的解析状态。",
  "Enable Isolated Workspaces": "启用隔离工作区",
  "Show execution workspace controls in project configuration and allow isolated workspace behavior for new and existing task runs.": "在项目配置中显示执行工作区控件，允许新旧任务运行使用隔离工作区行为。",
  "Experimental File Viewer": "实验性文件查看器",
  "Show task detail controls for browsing and previewing workspace files relative to a task.": "在任务详情页显示浏览和预览任务相关 workspace 文件的控件。",
  "Goals Sidebar Link": "Goals 侧边栏入口",
  "Restore the Goals item in the main sidebar while the goals surface is being evaluated.": "在 goals 界面评估期间，恢复主侧边栏的 Goals 项。",
  "Managed Environment Only": "仅托管环境",
  "Hide the local environment and run all agents in the platform-managed environment.": "隐藏本地环境，所有 agent 跑在平台托管环境中。",
  "Run tasks in this worktree": "在此 worktree 运行任务",
  "This is an isolated git-worktree preview instance. Turn this on to let the scheduler execute runs here. Only tasks created after enabling will run automatically — copied/pre-existing tasks stay parked. Toggling off and on resets the cutoff.": "这是隔离的 git-worktree 预览实例。开启后调度器在这里执行运行。只有开启后创建的任务会自动运行，复制/已有任务保持停放。开关一次会重置 cutoff。",
  "Execution is suppressed — effectively off.": "执行被抑制——实际等于关闭。",
  "This setting was armed in a different instance and copied here, so no tasks run automatically.": "该设置在其他实例激活并复制到这里，任务不会自动运行。",
  "This setting is missing its activation cutoff, so no tasks run automatically.": "该设置缺少激活 cutoff，任务不会自动运行。",
  "Toggle it off and back on to arm execution for tasks created here.": "关掉再打开，可为这里创建的任务激活执行。",
  "Server Info Debug View": "服务器信息调试视图",
  "Show a \"Server\" section in the account drawer with the current server restart time and running commit.": "在账户抽屉显示 Server 区块，含当前服务器重启时间和运行 commit。",
  "Simplified English Interactions": "简化英语交互",
  "Instruct agents to write user interactions (plan confirmations, questions, suggested tasks, checkbox prompts) in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English, with brief context on what information the decision needs and what happens for each choice.": "指示 agent 用 ASD-STE100 简化技术英语写用户交互（plan 确认、提问、建议任务、复选框提示），并简述决策所需信息和各选项的后果。",
  "Smoke Lab": "Smoke Lab",
  "Add a \"Smoke Lab\" tab under Apps → Developer and an \"Integration smoke\" card on the dashboard for exercising every integration path against deterministic local fixtures (fake OAuth provider + loopback MCP servers). Private (non-public) deployments only.": "在 Apps → Developer 下添加 Smoke Lab 标签页，并在仪表盘添加 Integration smoke 卡，用确定性本地 fixture（假 OAuth 提供方 + 回环 MCP 服务器）演练所有集成路径。仅私有部署。",
  "Status Cards": "状态卡",
  "Enable the experimental shared status-card board and its gated API. Existing card data is kept when this is disabled.": "启用实验性共享状态卡看板及其带门禁的 API。关闭时已有卡数据保留。",
  "Enabling Status Cards also enables Summaries.": "启用 Status Cards 会同时启用 Summaries。",
  "Summaries": "摘要",
  "Show Summarizer-generated status slots on project and workspace pages, with on-demand refresh and revision history. Existing summary data is kept when this is disabled.": "在项目和工作区页面显示 Summarizer 生成的状态槽，支持按需刷新和修订历史。关闭时已有摘要数据保留。",
  "Status Cards requires Summaries. Disabling Summaries also disables Status Cards.": "Status Cards 依赖 Summaries。关闭 Summaries 会同时关闭 Status Cards。",
  "Task Plan Decomposition Panel": "任务 Plan 拆解面板",
  "Show accepted-plan decomposition history on task detail pages. Intended for debugging and validating subtask creation behavior while the presentation is still being refined.": "在任务详情页显示已接受 plan 的拆解历史，用于在呈现方式打磨期间调试验证子任务创建行为。",
  "Task Watchdogs": "任务 Watchdog",
  "Show task detail controls for configuring watchdog agents that verify stopped task subtrees and restore live paths when work should continue.": "在任务详情页显示配置 watchdog agent 的控件，用于验证已停止的任务子树并在工作应继续时恢复活路径。",
  "Confirm auto-recovery": "确认自动恢复",
  "Checking recovery candidates before enabling.": "启用前正在检查恢复候选。",
  "No recovery tasks would be created right now. Auto-recovery can still run for future liveness incidents in this window.": "当前不会创建恢复任务。自动恢复仍会对该窗口内未来的 liveness 事件生效。",
  "Recovery target:": "恢复目标：",
